{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thunder Spikes Volleyball</strong> is a 2D video game where you can perform every volleyball move: spikes, tips, blocks, serves, and spectacular diving saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/4071e175093c3a26d5354a46646bdf2f.poster.avif?t=1762896837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/4071e175093c3a26d5354a46646bdf2f.webm?t=1762896837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/4071e175093c3a26d5354a46646bdf2f.mp4?t=1762896837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the defense mid-air, pick your move, and score! Just as reading the attack well can help you pull off satisfying <strong>monster blocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/f0f97e7c1feb9caa027e2e85bcb735c0.poster.avif?t=1762896837\" width=800 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/f0f97e7c1feb9caa027e2e85bcb735c0.webm?t=1762896837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907880/extras/f0f97e7c1feb9caa027e2e85bcb735c0.mp4?t=1762896837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer ( or online streaming via <strong>Steam Remote Play Together)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>1,500 frames</strong> of hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra